\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Act as a principal hospitality product designer, hotel BI architect, revenue-management analyst, finance-control specialist and senior frontend engineer.\
Design a complete professional Reporting & Insights Center for Stay360, a multi-tenant hospitality operating system for hotels, guest houses, serviced apartments and multi-property groups.\
Stay360 manages reservations, front desk, rooms, housekeeping, payments, guest folios, F&B, laundry, ironing, transportation, rent-a-car, maintenance, complaints, incidents, lost and found, inventory and guest communications.\
The reporting experience must remain easy enough for a small guest house while being credible for a professional hotel group.\
