\cf0 METRIC DEFINITIONS\
Define and display these formulas:\
Occupancy % =\uc0\u8232 Paid or occupied guest room-nights \'f7 sellable room-nights \'d7 100\
Show paid occupancy and total guest occupancy separately. State whether out-of-order and out-of-service rooms are removed from the denominator.\
ADR =\uc0\u8232 Recognized room revenue \'f7 paid occupied room-nights\
Exclude taxes, service charges, F&B, transport, cancellation fees, house-use and complimentary nights unless explicitly stated otherwise.\
RevPAR =\uc0\u8232 Recognized room revenue \'f7 sellable room-nights\
Pickup =\uc0\u8232 Current on-the-books rooms/revenue \u8722  prior snapshot for the same future stay dates\
Show new bookings, cancellations, modifications and net pickup separately.\
Booking window =\uc0\u8232 Arrival date \u8722  original booking-created date\
Length of stay =\uc0\u8232 Consumed room nights\
Preserve booked, expected and actual length of stay separately. Room moves must not create additional room nights.\
